  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CODERIMO Rice Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice Beneficiaries: 693 (386 women) Description: The group seeks to continue to increase the quality and quantity of hulled rice and by-products through further increases in yields; increase the percentage of members&apos; total production purchased by the coop for processing; construct an additional warehouse, buy another mill to increase the amount of paddy rice being hulled, begin a warrantage system (improved financial system and yearlong storage), and increase marketing skills.</narrative>
  </description>
